Song: laverca by Clo Plas (Berio Molina and Xiana Arias), from the album "bafi" (2022)
Licence: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)
Source: https://archive.org/details/bafi_20220513

Lyrics: transcribed by ear for the Galician benchmark (bench/sets/gl/cloplas-laverca) and shared
under the same licence.
Timings: made by Proxecto Karaoke en Galego 3.0.0 (`karaoke make`, with the lyrics), not corrected by hand. This is
the demo song of the project; the screenshots and the animation in docs/assets/ show it and are
shared under CC BY-SA 4.0 too.

The audio (vocals.wav, instrumental.wav) is never versioned. To rebuild it:
  uv run karaoke-bench fetch --set gl
  uv run karaoke make bench/data/gl/cloplas-laverca/audio.mp3 --lang gl \
    --lyrics bench/sets/gl/cloplas-laverca/lyrics.txt --title laverca --artist "Clo Plas" \
    --out bench/data/paquetes/cloplas-laverca
  for stem in instrumental vocals; do
    ffmpeg -i bench/data/paquetes/cloplas-laverca/$stem.m4a <this folder>/$stem.wav
  done
